import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.PeriodFamilyHolomorphicCohomologyOpenClassRestrictionEmbeddingComposition

/-!
# Exact literal restriction along original open embeddings

The actual image-open functor gives literal restriction of original
abelian sheaves. It is additive and preserves finite limits and finite
colimits, with no separation or compactness premise. Composition and
identity use the canonical isomorphisms induced by the actual equalities
of image opens. The original open-subspace inclusion gives exactly the
existing open-restriction functor. No cohomology or integer-endpoint
construction is introduced in this package.
-/
